    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295280</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>行ってきたぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And I'm back.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295352</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ご苦労様です。
ありがとうございました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well done, and thank
you very much.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295428</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いや、&lt;Suzu&gt;ちゃんの
役に立ててよかったな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Nah, don't mention it. I'm just
glad I could help you out, &lt;Suzu&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295512</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おや……そちらも
仕事は終わりましたか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh... You've finished
your work as well?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295572</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ。これで
よかったか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah. This should
be enough, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295816</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>これが……
おお、これぞまさしく……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This is... Oh,
this is perfect...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295816</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……ふむ、ふむ、ふむ……
なんと！！　アルヴァニスタの
政治資金が……ふむふむ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmm... Mhm... Mhm... Incredible!
Alvanista's political funds... Mhm...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295816</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>完璧です！　これがあれば、
アセリア全土にはびこる悪の
結社の根を絶つことができます！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Excellent! With this, we can
bring down a network of villains
that have plagued all of Aselia!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295904</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>アセリア全土……って……
んなでかい話だったのか……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wait...all of Aselia...?
This was that big a deal?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>296044</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>はい。しかし、ヤツらの
資金源を突き止めれば、
こちらのものですから</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yes. However, if we can cut
off their funding, they're as
good as finished.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>296044</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>では、取り急ぎ……
ゴメン……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then, forgive me, but I
must depart in haste...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>296172</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>すげー……世界を救うため、
悪の組織と戦う
正義の味方……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whoa... You're like, heroes
of justice, saving the world
from the clutches of evil...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>296172</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Suzu&gt;ちゃんの一族って
すげー……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Suzu&gt;, your clan's
legit awesome!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>296388</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そ、そんなすごいものでは
ありません</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I-It's, um, nothing that
incredible, truthfully.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>296388</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>我々は我々の利益を守るため、
これらの情報を元に世界の国々
と連携し、活動しているのみ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We operate mainly for our own benefit,
coordinating our intelligence network and
activities with the countries of the world.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>296388</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>世界を救うためとか、
そのような崇高な意思など、
とても……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Our intention is not to...
save the world, or anything
so terribly lofty as that...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>296500</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、結果的にそれが
世界を救うことになってる、
それは自慢していいことだろ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, the result's that you end up
saving the world, yeah? You can
totally take pride in that.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>296556</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そう、でしょうか……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Um, is that really so...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>296620</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……うん、そうだよ……
きっと</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Um... Yeah, I think
it is. Definitely.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>296732</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……そうですね……
ありがとうございます</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I see... Then, thank
you very much.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>296732</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お受け取りください。
お仕事のお礼です</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Please accept this. It is our
thanks for your work.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>296792</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え……んなの
いらねーよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh... I don't really
need it, though?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>296880</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いえ、仕事をしたら、
相当の報酬を受けるべき
なのです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No, if you've completed the
work, it's only right that
you receive suitable payment.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>296940</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そっか、
んじゃ、遠慮なく</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh, okay.
Then, I'll take it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297056</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いちち……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oww...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297108</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Dio&gt;、平気！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Are you okay, &lt;Dio&gt;!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297184</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>全然、だいじょーぶだよ、
かすり傷だって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm perfectly fine.
Just a little scratch.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297268</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おや……そちらも
仕事は終わりましたか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh... You've finished
your work as well?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297396</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ。見つかったけど、
なんとか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah. Or well, they kinda
found me, but more or less.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297396</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あいつら、オレを
追いかけてきて戻る時、
こいつ落としてったぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>When they were heading
back after chasing me out,
one of 'em dropped this.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297548</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ふむふむ…………
………………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmm... Mhm...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297548</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>申し訳ありませんが……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My apologies, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297548</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>これはイチゴを
美味しく食べる方法が
書かれているメモです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This is a note on the
most satisfying way
to eat a strawberry.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297604</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>な、なんだって……！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>W-Wait, what...!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297652</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>失敗したね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You failed...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
